OL,3,GNEWSAReform takes legal advice over
OL,4,A'crazy' council letter
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe leader of Worcestershire County
OL,7,FCouncil is embroiled in a row over a
OL,8,Fletter sent to central government which
OL,9,Furges ministers to press ahead with
OL,10,Fproposals for two new authorities.
OL,12,FGreen councillor Matt Jenkins has
OL,13,Fco-signed a letter to Angela Rayner,
OL,14,Fasking her to "lift the pause" on local
OL,15,Fgovernment reorganisation and approve
OL,16,Fthe creation of two new councils for
OL,17,Fnorth and south Worcestershire.
OL,19,FBut his own deputy leader Adam Kent has
OL,20,Fwritten to ministers urging them to
OL,21,Fignore the letter, saying it "does not
OL,22,Freflect the position of the council".
OL,23,APub: 29-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBC Eng (W) NewsCReg TVFWeather
